  "details": "Go into a public world, or private.\n\nUse bubbles a lot, either yourself or with external applications.\n\nBubble quality will slowly dip and become less and less consistent, seems to be time and user based.\n\nThis causes bubbles to speed up or sometimes stick around forever, also causes the ... next to them to appear/disappear at random.\n\nThis behavior only started recently, causes massive issues with bubbles being stuck on the users screen or being minutes behind.",
